  description: '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters

    If you would take damage from
    a card effect, place 1 Black Feather Counter on this card instead. This card
    loses 700 ATK for each Black Feather Counter on it. Once per turn: You can remove
    all Black Feather Counters on this card, then target 1 face-up monster your opponent
    controls; that target loses 700 ATK for each Black Feather Counter you removed,
    and if it does, inflict damage to your opponent equal to the ATK lost by this
    effect.'
